sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Symptom-Intake
    participant C as Severity-Classifier
    participant S as Safety-Override
    participant R as Care-Routing
    participant H as Human-in-the-Loop
    participant D as Clinician-Handoff
    participant F as Reflection
    O->>C: symptoms.normalised
    C-->>S: acuity.classified
    C-->>R: acuity.classified
    C-->>H: acuity.classified
    O->>S: safety.assessment.requested
    S-->>R: safety.override
    S-->>H: safety.override
    S-->>D: safety.override
    S-->>F: safety.override
    Note right of S: can only RAISE acuity
    R-->>H: care.routed
    R-->>D: care.routed
    R-->>F: care.routed
    H->>F: review.decision
    alt case escalated
        D->>O: handoff.ready
    end
    F->>O: decision.reviewed
